        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "己卯年，若艮丙巽辛一同言，口舌官非病又缠，四八月中端的见，更兼损马及牛田。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
